- SymmetricDivisorM0nbar -- negate a symmetric divisor
******************************************************

  * Operator: *note -: (Macaulay2Doc)-,
  * Usage: 
        -D
  * Inputs:
      * D, an instance of the type *note SymmetricDivisorM0nbar:
        SymmetricDivisorM0nbar,,
  * Outputs:
      * E, an instance of the type *note SymmetricDivisorM0nbar:
        SymmetricDivisorM0nbar,,

Description
===========

Let $Pic(\bar{M}_{0,n})_Q^{S_n}$ denote the vector space of $S_n$-invariant
divisors with rational coefficients.  Here, given an $S_n$ symmetric
$Q$-divisor $D$ on $\bar{M}_{0,n}$, the function returns $-D$.



+---------------------------------------+
|i1 : D=symmetricDivisorM0nbar(6,{2,3}) |
|                                       |
|o1 = 2*B  + 3*B                        |
|        2      3                       |
|                                       |
|o1 : S_6-symmetric divisor on M-0-6-bar|
+---------------------------------------+
|i2 : E=-D                              |
|                                       |
|o2 = - 2*B  - 3*B                      |
|          2      3                     |
|                                       |
|o2 : S_6-symmetric divisor on M-0-6-bar|
+---------------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note - SymmetricDivisorM0nbar: - SymmetricDivisorM0nbar, -- negate a
    symmetric divisor
