===========================================================

  * *note - SymmetricDivisorM0nbar: - SymmetricDivisorM0nbar, -- negate a
    symmetric divisor
  * "coefficientList(SymmetricDivisorM0nbar)" -- see *note coefficientList:
    coefficientList, -- the coefficients of a symmetric divisor D in the
