symmetricFCurves -- a list of all symmetric F-curves given n
************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        symmetricFCurves(8)
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * B, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

This is the list of *note F curves: F curve, up to $S_n$ symmetry, i.e., this
function generates partitions of the integer $n$ into 4 positive integers, not
partitions of the set {1,...,n} into four nonempty subsets.



+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : symmetricFCurves(8)                                                   |
|                                                                           |
|o1 = {{5, 1, 1, 1}, {4, 2, 1, 1}, {3, 3, 1, 1}, {3, 2, 2, 1}, {2, 2, 2, 2}}|
|                                                                           |
|o1 : List                                                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+

